## 0\. HOW TO WORK (READ FIRST)

- You are building a real, running web app, not a mockup. Every route in §4 must render, every button must do something, every list must be backed by data.  
- Build in the phases of §15. Finish and verify Phase 1 completely before starting Phase 2\. If you run out of room, stop at a clean phase boundary, list what remains under "Next steps" in `README.md`, and say so. Never leave a phase half-built.  
